# Built workspace — Cargo target/ is gitignored by default, but we
# also ignore generated alloy fragments and the local binary.

target/
target-docker/

# Dependencies that are explicitly vendored for offline builds.
# .vendor/ stores a snapshot of crates.io deps; re-generate via:
#   cargo vendor --locked  # (do not commit)

.vendor/

# Local user configuration — copy this file to an ignored key path
# before adding real API keys.
config.local.toml
.env
.test.env

# Local test state — home directories created by the test harness
# or by `scripts/play.sh`.
.bloom-local/
.bloom-play/

# Per-seat local scratch notes — not tracked, but always available.
# Create this file under `docs/.scratch/` if you need a place for
# work-in-progress notes.
docs/.scratch/

# Generated litigation search data — the indexing scripts produce
# synthesized markdown under lit/ and nl-to-invariant/ stays tracked.
docs/research/formal-verification/lit/data/

# Local-only agent/PR docs — kept on disk, deliberately never committed.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
DIRECTION.md
PR.md

# Local-only docs/examples — kept on disk, deliberately out of the PR.
# Implementation plans are local-only (may reference private wallets, internal
# direction, WIP trade strategy). Superseded plans are archived locally under
# docs/archive/. Use docs/.scratch/ for temporary local notes.
docs/plans/
docs/archive/
docs/.scratch/
docs/research/README.md
docs/research/strategy/
docs/research/formal-verification/nl-to-invariant/data/
docs/STRATEGY.md
docs/direction-overview.html
docs/strategy-overview.html
docs/evm-tx-path-audit-2026-06-12.md
docs/polymarket-audit-2026-06-12.md
# Live probe log — contains real owner/deposit addresses and trade amounts.
docs/polymarket-discovery-findings.md
docs/research/usd-policy-valuation.md
examples/polymarket-probe/
# Local-only live trading script — names a private wallet + owner address.
scripts/hl_session_trader.sh
AGENTS.local.md
